{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The filing entity is classified separately under the circular's definition of licensed firms; no classification is inferred from its use of STREAMS 2.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The specific 9:00am launch and resumption provision determines the post-launch boundary for this model when read with the general effective-date provision.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Each assessed event has an identifiable submission method; a later resubmission is a separate event.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Footnote 3 applies to the XML and PDF alternatives carrying its marker. No e-Cert requirement for the web-based alternative is inferred from this footnote.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Certificate satisfaction means that a Hongkong Post e-Cert is supplied or used for this particular submission in the required manner; mere firm-level possession does not establish that fact.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result covers only the selected channel, method and certificate requirements. It does not decide the STR's substantive adequacy, filing timeliness, XML schema conformity, technical testing or overall legal compliance.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"c999b7feb78291eab7921c46bbb28978bb071d6e4bc87f40da2a38cca599315b","candidate_id":"candidate.65e7ee1144214eec9681b14802f6ef18","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For an in-scope post-launch submission by a classified licensed firm, true means that the STR was submitted to the JFIU through STREAMS 2 using XML with the required Hongkong Post e-Cert, a completed prescribed PDF form with that e-Cert, or the completed STREAMS 2 web-based STR form. False means that at least one of these selected requirements was not met. An unknown input remains unknown, and an out-of-scope event receives no compliance verdict. This answers only whether the assessed submission meets the selected channel, method and footnote 3 requirements; it confers no legal approval.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["dependencies"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.35eca2b7507542c3b63bc1418289ef8a","issue.c56afa580aad4c619ab4baeed1dda0aa","issue.748b131ff16a40948341235e6cc982f1","issue.788930e624c44d09a2592723db8145e0","issue.b3365d83bad2499b858fe4b56401f00e","issue.a89f4bb048574fbfa4e7937f64f0ba46"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"A single fact such as electronic_submission would conceal the distinction between channel and format, while firm_has_ecert would conceal the submission-specific certificate requirement. XML and PDF require both the STREAMS 2 channel and the footnote 3 certificate condition. The retained text does not attach that certificate condition to the web-based alternative. The blackout is excluded from this ordinary post-launch rule.","run_id":"run.f9cab12e5709452f9b6e3121495ab6bf","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"71c3627a60fbdf7e662cc30b3dae7b8ff95e13a67ad5eade35f0a35874e23663","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Post-launch channel, submission method and method-specific e-Cert requirements"}